      "widgets_values": [
        "Photoreal live-action, one continuous shot at normal real-time speed. Use <Picture 1> for the adult performer's identity and clothing. Full-body view in a concrete training courtyard under soft daylight. The performer takes three fast running steps, vaults a low concrete barrier, lands with both feet and bent knees, then takes two recovery steps. Keep the whole body and its ground contact visible. Preserve body proportions, clothing, environment and direction of travel throughout the shot. Show weight transfer, believable momentum and a clear landing response. The camera tracks smoothly from the side. Audio: synchronized footsteps, clothing movement, landing impact and natural outdoor ambience. No dialogue, music, slow motion, cuts, captions or logos."
      ],
